#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:5
#: 296c236e7503450b88344b4666e34181
msgid "Traditional Helicopter – Tailrotor Setup"
msgstr "传统直升机 – 尾旋翼设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:7
#: 7e9df63cd49d49eeac43b52b80ddb50d
msgid ""
"There are several ways for controlling the tailrotor to maintain yaw "
"stabilization and provide yaw control, and each have a unique setup.  The "
":ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` parameter is used to specify method for "
"controlling the tailrotor.  A list of available tail types is given below:"
msgstr ""
"有几种控制尾旋翼以保持偏航稳定性和提供偏航控制的方法，每种方法都有独特的设置。:ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` "
"参数用于指定控制尾旋翼的方法。可用尾翼类型列于下方："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:9
#: 099361c2700743228bd928433e6b38de
msgid ""
"Servo Only: ArduPilot will supply the tail rotor stabilization like a tail "
"rotor gyro and control the pitch of the tail rotor blades."
msgstr "仅舵机：ArduPilot 将提供尾旋翼稳定，类似尾旋翼陀螺仪，并控制尾旋翼桨叶螺距。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:10
#: 6a974e7be30348d1b79e59eb79ce5a15
msgid ""
"Servo with External Gyro: ArduPilot will output yaw demands without direct "
"yaw attitude stabilization which is provided via an external gyro."
msgstr "带外部陀螺仪的舵机：ArduPilot 将输出偏航需求，而不提供直接偏航姿态稳定，偏航姿态稳定由外部陀螺仪提供。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:11
#: 1c0b6c53d1bb4d5eb311d6cdadbc3bb0
msgid ""
"Direct Drive Variable Pitch (DDVP): Instead of the tail rotor being driven "
"from the main rotor via mechanical coupling as in the above cases, an "
"electric motor is used with motor controlled(ramp up/down, operating point) "
"by ArduPilot. Main yaw control is via tail blade pitch servo, as above."
msgstr ""
"直驱变螺距（DDVP）：尾旋翼不是通过机械连接从主旋翼驱动（如上述情况），而是使用电动电机，电机由 ArduPilot "
"控制（启动/关闭、工作点）。主要偏航控制通过尾桨桨叶螺距舵机，如上所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:12
#: fdf2ef6380134d8388c93f9fafb01d3b
msgid ""
"Direct Drive Fixed Pitch Clockwise (DDFP CW): Tail rotor is driven by a "
"motor whose ESC is controlled by ArduPilot to maintain yaw stability and yaw"
" direction. Used with clockwise rotating main rotors, when viewed from "
"above."
msgstr ""
"直驱固定螺距顺时针（DDFP CW）：尾旋翼由电机驱动，其 ESC 由 ArduPilot "
"控制以保持偏航稳定性和偏航方向。从上方看，用于顺时针旋转的主旋翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:13
#: a8383e774a9e4f55b763178678ab5ed6
msgid ""
"Direct Drive Fixed Pitch Counter-Clockwise (DDFP CCW): Tail rotor driven by "
"a motor whose ESC is controlled by ArudPilot to maintain yaw stability and "
"yaw direction. Used with counter-clockwise rotating main rotors, when viewed"
" from above."
msgstr ""
"直驱固定螺距逆时针（DDFP CCW）：尾旋翼由电机驱动，其 ESC 由 ArduPilot "
"控制以保持偏航稳定性和偏航方向。从上方看，用于逆时针旋转的主旋翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:17
#: 296aca3edc174866b199e04789eabc1e
msgid "Tailrotor Types"
msgstr "尾旋翼类型"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:20
#: c3d83f99f29d400b9ba1e9df38c6bc25
msgid "Servo Only :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 0"
msgstr "仅舵机 :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:22
#: 6c0692fe7d55482ea59f61ed46455bc5
msgid ""
"The Servo Only tail type uses a servo connected to an autopilot output whose"
" ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` is selected as ``Motor4`` to control the tailrotor "
"pitch slider.  The tailrotor speed is controlled by a physical connection "
"(tailrotor shaft or belt) to the engine and main shaft. Depending on your "
"servo setup and mechanical throws, set the ``SERVOx_MIN``, ``SERVOx_MAX``, "
"and ``SERVOx_REVERSED`` parameter values.  Setting the ``SERVOx_TRIM`` is "
"discussed below."
msgstr ""
"仅舵机尾翼类型使用连接到飞控输出（其 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 选择为 "
"``Motor4``）的舵机来控制尾旋翼螺距滑块。尾旋翼转速通过与发动机和主轴的物理连接（尾旋翼轴或皮带）控制。根据您的舵机设置和机械行程，设置 "
"``SERVOx_MIN``、``SERVOx_MAX`` 和 ``SERVOx_REVERSED`` 参数值。``SERVOx_TRIM`` "
"的设置在下方讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:24
#: 23590dad17a848ca99c2487a020b0074
msgid ""
"Be sure to check the direction of operation of the Tail Servo. Move the "
"rudder stick and notice the change in tail rotor pitch. Be sure that its "
"increase or decrease of pitch is such that the change in thrust will result "
"in the desired direction of movement. If not, reverse the servo direction "
"with the ``SERVOx_REVERSED`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"务必检查尾翼舵机的工作方向。移动方向舵摇杆并注意尾旋翼螺距的变化。确保螺距的增加或减少使推力变化产生期望的移动方向。如果不是，使用 "
"``SERVOx_REVERSED`` 参数反转舵机方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:27
#: ffa07aa6d64d482c8d9f29185446bded
msgid "Servo with External Gyro :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 1"
msgstr "带外部陀螺仪的舵机 :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:29
#: f0fb6af02577453a967a4fe103134d97
msgid ""
"Instead of ArduPilot controlling both the desired yaw rate and stability, "
"this option relies on an external gyro for stabilization. A servo is still "
"used to input yaw rate demands to the tail and its setup as above, for the "
"Servo Only case."
msgstr ""
"此选项不是 ArduPilot 同时控制期望偏航速率和稳定性，而是依赖外部陀螺仪进行稳定。舵机仍用于向尾翼输入偏航速率需求，其设置与上面仅舵机情况相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:31
#: 65bbf15f4c59451eb4ea93ab392fbd28
msgid ""
"The external gyro gain can be set by the ``H_GYR_GAIN`` parameter using the "
"autopilot's \"Motor7\" output function,``SERVOx_FUNCTION``."
msgstr "外部陀螺仪增益可通过 ``H_GYR_GAIN`` 参数设置，使用飞控的 \"Motor7\" 输出功能 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION``。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:33
#: 69d38e5aa3714ebc9a25b15c9a1fae1f
msgid ""
"In ACRO mode, this gain can be changed to the value of the "
"``H_GYR_GAIN_ACRO`` parameter, if non-zero."
msgstr "在 ACRO 模式下，如果 ``H_GYR_GAIN_ACRO`` 参数非零，此增益可变更为该参数的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:36
#: eae5a81ee9d9486ca5836b996783fa4b
msgid "Direct Drive Variable Pitch :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 2"
msgstr "直驱变螺距 :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:38
#: b94aa23b9d184eeb890fb84b0bd268d9
msgid ""
"The Direct Drive Variable Pitch (DDVP) tail type uses a separate tail motor "
"with a variable pitch propeller.  A separate servo is used to control the "
"tailrotor pitch.  The setup of the servo is similar to the servo only tail "
"type. ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` \"Motor4\" is assigned to the output number that "
"corresponds to the servo channel the tailrotor servo is physically connected"
" (defaults to output 4).  For the tail motor, the \"HeliTailRSC\" (\"32\") "
"is assigned to the motor/servo channel to which the tail motor ESC is "
"physically connected (defaults to output 7)."
msgstr ""
"直驱变螺距（DDVP）尾翼类型使用带变螺距螺旋桨的独立尾翼电机。使用独立舵机控制尾旋翼螺距。舵机的设置类似于仅舵机尾翼类型。``SERVOx_FUNCTION``"
" \"Motor4\" 分配给与尾旋翼舵机物理连接的输出编号（默认为输出 "
"4）。对于尾翼电机，\"HeliTailRSC\"（\"32\"）分配给尾翼电机 ESC 物理连接的电机/舵机通道（默认为输出 7）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:40
#: e7871e96fcf74c498299666e22052f6f
msgid ""
"The range of the motor ESC is controlled by its output's ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX`` "
"parameters and ArduPilot will ramp it output up or down, as appropriate, to "
"its normal operating value set by the :ref:`H_TAIL_SPEED<H_TAIL_SPEED>` "
"parameter."
msgstr ""
"电机 ESC 的范围由其输出的 ``SERVOx_MIN/MAX`` 参数控制，ArduPilot 将根据需要将其输出升高或降低到由 "
":ref:`H_TAIL_SPEED<H_TAIL_SPEED>` 参数设置的正常工作值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:43
#: bf0718f562b44838bf743da89df5b9da
msgid "Direct Drive Fixed Pitch :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 3 or 4"
msgstr "直驱固定螺距 :ref:`H_TAIL_TYPE <H_TAIL_TYPE>` = 3 或 4"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:45
#: 5de76b4686a5462b8dd4b9fa1a41a79d
msgid ""
"The Direct Drive Fixed Pitch (DDFP) tail type uses a fixed pitch tail rotor "
"and separate motor. The stabilization and yaw is controlled by the speed of "
"this motor. It has two options: one where the main rotor rotates clockwise "
"when viewed from above and the other where the main rotor rotates counter-"
"clockwise when viewed from above.  Be sure to select the DDFP tail type for "
"the main rotor rotation.  In this case, the control of tailrotor thrust is "
"accomplished through tailrotor speed since it is a fixed pitch propeller. "
"The ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` of \"36\" (Motor4) should be assigned to the servo "
"channel to which the tailrotor ESC is physically connected.  On new DDFP "
"setups it is suggested to set ``H_DDFP_THST_EXPO`` to .65 as a starting "
"point.  This will be a good enough thrust expo for most aircraft."
msgstr ""
"直驱固定螺距（DDFP）尾桨类型使用固定螺距尾旋翼和独立电机，稳定和偏航通过该电机的转速控制。它有两个选项：一个用于从上方看主旋翼顺时针旋转的情况，另一个用于从上方看主旋翼逆时针旋转的情况。务必根据主旋翼旋转方向选择相应的"
" DDFP 尾桨类型。在这种情况下，由于是固定螺距螺旋桨，尾旋翼推力通过尾旋翼转速控制。应将值为 \"36\"（Motor4）的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配给尾旋翼电调实际连接的舵机通道。对于新的 DDFP 设置，建议将 ``H_DDFP_THST_EXPO`` "
"设为 0.65 作为起点。这对大多数飞行器来说是足够好的推力 expo 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:47
#: 13e8f8248ffc489eb17d047f630e883e
msgid ""
"There are several parameters that provide the ability to linearize the "
"thrust produced by the tail rotor motor and therefore provide better "
"control:"
msgstr "有几个参数提供线性化尾旋翼电机产生的推力并因此提供更好控制的能力："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:49
#: 60fe5d07d6f94fe6bf61c41b6c133f55
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_THST_EXPO<H_DDFP_THST_EXPO>` - Tail rotor DDFP motor thrust "
"curve exponent (0.0 for linear to 1.0 for second order curve). A suggested "
"starting point for tuning this parameter is .65 and will often give better "
"better results than the default. Default = 0 (for legacy compatibility "
"reason)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_THST_EXPO<H_DDFP_THST_EXPO>` - 尾旋翼 DDFP 电机推力曲线指数（0.0 为线性，1.0 "
"为二次曲线）。调参时建议的起始值为 .65，通常会比默认值获得更好的效果。默认值 = 0（出于兼容旧版的原因）"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:50
#: f0f2772591cd40f9812a1da0138148f9
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_SPIN_MIN<H_DDFP_SPIN_MIN>` - Point at which the DDFP motor "
"thrust starts expressed as a number from 0 to 1 in the entire output range."
"  Default = 0"
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_SPIN_MIN<H_DDFP_SPIN_MIN>` - DDFP 电机推力开始点，表示为整个输出范围的 0 到 1 "
"之间的数值。默认值 = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:51
#: 1c5d5f759f9f4c6ba55f23010617b468
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_SPIN_MAX<H_DDFP_SPIN_MAX>` - Point at which the DDFP motor "
"thrust saturates expressed as a number from 0 to 1 in the entire output "
"range. Default = 1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_SPIN_MAX<H_DDFP_SPIN_MAX>` - DDFP 电机推力饱和点，表示为整个输出范围的 0 到 1 "
"之间的数值。默认值 = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:52
#: 224ec0b5af98410081da9e715af0a3eb
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_IDX<H_DDFP_BAT_IDX>` - Index of battery to be used for "
"voltage compensation. Default = 0."
msgstr ":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_IDX<H_DDFP_BAT_IDX>` - 用于电压补偿的电池索引。默认值 = 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:53
#: 3b5b8052f27d4170ad795eed6fe63baf
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_V_MAX<H_DDFP_BAT_V_MAX>` - Battery voltage compensation "
"maximum voltage (voltage above this will have no additional scaling effect "
"on thrust). Recommend 4.2 * cell count, 0 = Disabled. Default = 0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_V_MAX<H_DDFP_BAT_V_MAX>` - "
"电池电压补偿最大电压（高于此值的电压将不对推力产生额外的缩放效果）。建议设为 4.2 * 电芯数，0 = 禁用。默认值 = 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:54
#: 1cb4b7d69f64445f937ae14d79fe7c21
msgid ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_V_MIN<H_DDFP_BAT_V_MIN>` - Battery voltage compensation "
"minimum voltage (voltage below this will have no additional scaling effect "
"on thrust). Recommend 3.3 * cell count, 0 = Disabled. Default = 0."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_DDFP_BAT_V_MIN<H_DDFP_BAT_V_MIN>` - "
"电池电压补偿最小电压（低于此值的电压将不对推力产生额外的缩放效果）。建议设为 3.3 * 电芯数，0 = 禁用。默认值 = 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-tailrotor-setup.rst:56
#: 905920f5d9b8456992bf488213b5f716
msgid ""
"These parameters should be set similarly to how Copter's motor scaling "
"parameterss are setup. See :ref:`Copters Motor Thrust Scaling <motor-thrust-"
"scaling>` document for more information."
msgstr ""
"这些参数的设置应类似于 Copter 电机缩放参数的设置方式。有关更多信息，请参见 :ref:`Copter 电机推力缩放 <motor-thrust-"
"scaling>` 文档。"

